{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1468","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"L. Prime Divisors Selection"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Suppose you have a sequence of $$$k$$$ integers $$$A = [a_1, a_2, \\dots , a_k]$$$ where each $$$a_i \\geq 2$$$. A sequence of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"prime"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$P = [p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_k]$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suitable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for the sequence $$$A$$$ if $$$a_1$$$ is divisible by $$$p_1$$$, $$$a_2$$$ is divisible by $$$p_2$$$ and so on. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"prime"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$P$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"friendly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if there are no unique integers in this sequence. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A sequence $$$A$$$ is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", if each sequence $$$P$$$ that is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suitable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for $$$A$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"friendly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" as well (i. e. there is no sequence $$$P$$$ that is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suitable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for $$$A$$$, but not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"friendly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"). For example, the sequence $$$[2, 4, 16]$$$ is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", while the sequence $$$[2, 4, 6]$$$ is not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (there exists a sequence $$$P = [2, 2, 3]$$$ which is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suitable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for $$$A$$$, but not "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"friendly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ different integers $$$x_1$$$, $$$x_2$$$, ..., $$$x_n$$$. You have to choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k$$$ of them in such a way that they form an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence, or report that it is impossible. Note that no integer can be chosen more than once."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\leq k \\leq n \\leq 1000$$$). "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ pairwise distinct integers $$$x_1$$$, $$$x_2$$$, ..., $$$x_n$$$ ($$$2 \\leq x_i \\leq 10^{18}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If it is impossible to choose exactly $$$k$$$ integers from $$$x_1$$$, $$$x_2$$$, ..., $$$x_n$$$ in such a way that the chosen integers form an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence, print $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise, print $$$k$$$ pairwise distinct integers — the elements of the chosen "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ideal"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sequence. If there are multiple answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 3\n2 4 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 3\n2 4 16\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4 16 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 3\n2 4 6 16\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 4 16 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"L","problemCode":"1468L","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1468/problem/L"}